<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Irvine Apartment cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Irvine Apartment cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers said it downgraded Irvine Apartment Communities Inc to hold from buy based on price appreciation.</p>
<p>-- said remains positive on company's fundamentals.</p>
<p>-- set 12-month price target of $29.50 a share.</p>
<p>-- raised 1997 funds from operations (FFO) estimate to $1.99 a share from $1.94 a share and increased the 1998 FFO estimate to $2.21 a share from $2.13 a share.</p>
<p>-- Irvine lost 1/8 to 28-1/4 in late morning trade.</p>
</text>
